## Delivered

- `AnalysisProgress.tsx` (new): six-stage indicator (规划/检索/分析/反方/综合/验证)
  + an accessible progress bar driven by the run's OWN persisted progress, with
  each stage's digest hanging on its own stage row instead of a flat list.
  Independent passes (safety anchor / chief of staff) render outside the six
  stages so they are never mistaken for pipeline stages.
- Queued honesty: progress stays at 0 while queued (nothing creeps forward);
  after 30s a warning appears, after 180s it escalates and says the worker is
